// AdminSettings.activePaymentGateway — switches between the configured
// gateways platform-wide; deliberately its own column rather than buried in a
// Json settings blob since app code branches on it directly. Polar is the
// gateway that can do off-session/card-on-file charging from a Pakistan-based
// merchant account — Stripe cannot onboard Pakistan, LemonSqueezy cannot store
// cards at all (see PaymentMethodGateway).
enum PaymentGateway {
  stripe
  lemonsqueezy
